<title>GERMANY: Goldschmidt 9-mo pre-tax profit up 54.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Goldschmidt 9-mo pre-tax profit up 54.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to the end of September 1996 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     34.6    up 54.5 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales				  976.1   up 1.4 percent</p>
<p>    Parent pre-tax profit		    32.4    up 50 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German chemicals company is Th. Goldschmidt AG. The group said in a compulsory statement that domestic sales fell 7.9 percent in the period, while foreign sales 9.3 percent. Foreign sales made up 59 percent of sales, compared to 55 percent same time last year.</p>
</text>
